+# 11. VOLUNTEER REGISTRATION FLOW
+
+Flow:
+
+```text
+Browse Event
+↓
+Event Detail
+↓
+Select Role
+↓
+Registration Form
+↓
+Validation
+↓
+Submit
+↓
+Pending
+↓
+Review
+↓
+Accepted / Rejected / Waitlisted
+↓
+Assignment
+↓
+Schedule
+↓
